  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞{F5 C1 0E 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}、风花和理世\n　正在交谈……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_121.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 02 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}看来你们刚才挺不容易的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_121.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4C 0B}我们正在和{F5 C1 0D 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}说\n刚才的事。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_121.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}就是由加莉的事……\n虽然有点犹豫，但我想，\n还是让副队长也了解一下比较好。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_121.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 DE 04}我是不是对由加莉说得太过分了……\n希望她没有生气，也没有受伤……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_121.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我想没事的。\n由加莉是个既坚强又温柔的人。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_121.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}嗯……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_121.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 48 0B}理世，谢谢你。\n为我们考虑了这么多。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_121.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0F 01 01 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}本来，这应该是我们自己察觉，\n再由我们自己想办法解决的事……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_121.bf.json:6:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}接下来，就让我和由加莉自己……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_121.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 08 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2E 01}……我受伤了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_121.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 CE 0A}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}咦！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_121.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}开玩笑的。\n不过，不是当事人，\n就不能帮忙、不能担心了吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
